{"Sharp", "锐利"},
{"Smooth", "平滑"},
{"How the finished picture is scaled to the window: smooth (bilinear) or sharp (nearest pixel).", "将画面缩放到窗口时使用的滤镜：平滑（双线性）或锐利（最近邻）。"},
{"Texture filter", "纹理滤镜"},
{"How the game's textures are sampled: smooth (bilinear) or sharp (nearest texel).", "游戏纹理的采样方式：平滑（双线性）或锐利（最近邻）。"},
{"Draws an HD texture pack in PPSSPP's format from textures/NPJB40001 in the data folder instead of the game's textures.", "使用数据目录 textures/NPJB40001 中的 PPSSPP 格式高清材质包替换原版纹理。"},
