{"Off (immediate)", "关闭（立即呈现）"},
{"Vsync", "垂直同步"},
{"On waits for the display's refresh and never tears. Off shows each frame at once; the game's speed is the same either way.", "开启后等待屏幕刷新，避免画面撕裂。关闭后立即显示每一帧。两种模式均不改变游戏速度。"},
{"Match display", "跟随屏幕"},
{"Frames between the game's 30 a second, blending its movement. Steps down by itself rather than slow the game.", "在游戏原有的每秒 30 帧之间插入过渡帧，使动作更流畅。性能不足时自动降低帧率，优先保持游戏速度。"},
{"Game speed is Unlimited", "游戏速度已设为不限速"},
{" (running at ", "（当前运行于 "},
{"With Vsync on, no faster than the display refreshes.", "开启垂直同步时，帧率不会超过屏幕刷新率。"},
{"Lowered to keep the game at full speed; it tries the chosen rate again later.", "为保持游戏全速运行，已临时降低帧率；稍后会重试所选帧率。"},
{"Frame rate", "帧率"},
{"On lowers the frame rate by itself when presenting that often would slow the game. Off keeps the chosen rate, and the game may then run below full speed.", "开启后，在高帧率导致游戏减速时自动降低帧率。关闭后保持所选帧率，性能不足时游戏可能变慢。"},
{"Lower when behind", "性能不足时降低帧率"},
{"Game speed", "游戏速度"},
{"Unlimited", "不限速"},
{"Normal", "正常"},
{"Normal holds the game to real time. Unlimited lets it run as fast as frames can be drawn, which also speeds up the game.", "正常模式按实际时间运行。不限速模式尽可能快地绘制画面，也会加快游戏本身。"},
{"Lets the game run ahead of real time while it loads and is silent, so loads take as long as the computer needs. Never during play, sound, movies or ad hoc play.", "仅在无声的加载阶段加速运行，缩短等待时间。不会加速正常游玩、音频、动画或联机过程。"},
{"Fast loading", "快速加载"},
{"Overlay", "屏幕叠加"},
{"Overlay and log", "叠加并记录日志"},
{"Log only", "仅日志"},
{"Performance", "性能信息"},
{"Frame times and speed in the top-left corner, and a [perf] line per second on the console. F3 shows or hides the overlay.", "在左上角显示帧耗时和速度，并每秒向控制台输出一行 [perf] 日志。按 F3 显示或隐藏叠加信息。"},
