{"Which face button confirms, in the game and in this menu. The game's prompts show ○ to confirm and × to go back.", "游戏和菜单使用哪个面部按键确认。游戏内提示显示 ○ 确认、× 返回。"},
{"Stick dead zone", "摇杆死区"},
{"How far the left stick moves before the hunter does. Raise it if the hunter drifts.", "左摇杆推动多远后猎人才移动。出现漂移时可调高。"},
{"Trigger point", "扳机触发点"},
{"How far LT/RT (L2/R2) travel before they press anything.", "LT/RT（L2/R2）按下多深后触发按键。"},
{"Standard (L / R)", "标准（L / R）"},
{"Bows (R / △)", "弓（R / △）"},
{"Bowguns (R / ○)", "弩（R / ○）"},
{"Trigger profile", "扳机配置"},
{"What LT/RT (L2/R2) press. Standard: L and R, like the shoulders. Bows: R to aim and △ to shoot. Bowguns: R to aim and ○ to fire. R1, △ and ○ keep working.", "LT/RT（L2/R2）的功能。标准：L 和 R，与肩键相同。弓：R 瞄准、△ 射击。弩：R 瞄准、○ 开火。R1、△ 和 ○ 仍可使用。"},
{"Camera", "镜头"},
{"D-pad", "方向键"},
{"Right stick", "右摇杆"},
{"Camera uses the HD release's own right-stick camera. D-pad presses the D-pad instead, like the PSP's camera controls.", "镜头模式使用 HD 版原有的右摇杆镜头。方向键模式模拟 PSP 的方向键操作。"},
{"Turn and tilt the quest camera as far as the stick is pushed, instead of the game's fixed-speed turn and vertical presets. Release holds the angle; the D-pad and recentre return to the game's camera. Off is the game's own camera, untouched.", "根据摇杆推动幅度连续旋转和俯仰任务镜头。松开后保持角度；方向键与归位操作交还给原版镜头。关闭后使用原版镜头。"},
{"Right stick is not the camera", "右摇杆未设为镜头"},
{"Analog camera", "模拟摇杆镜头"},
{"How fast the camera turns at full deflection, in degrees a second.", "摇杆推到底时的镜头转速，单位为度/秒。"},
{"Analog camera is off", "模拟摇杆镜头已关闭"},
{"Camera speed", "镜头速度"},
{"%d deg/s", "%d 度/秒"},
