{"Hunter name", "猎人名字"},
{"When the game asks for a name", "游戏请求输入名字时"},
{"On-screen keyboard", "屏幕键盘"},
{"Use the name below", "使用下方名字"},
{"On-screen keyboard: type the name with the gamepad or the keyboard while the game waits. Otherwise the name below is given at once.", "屏幕键盘：游戏等待时，用手柄或键盘输入名字。否则直接使用下方预设的名字。"},
{"Given when the game asks for a name and the on-screen keyboard is off, and to other players when the network nickname is empty. Letters, digits, spaces and simple punctuation.", "关闭屏幕键盘时自动使用此名字。联机昵称为空时也使用它。支持字母、数字、空格和简单标点。"},
{"Keyboard and mouse", "键盘与鼠标"},
{"While the game runs, the window takes the pointer: moving the mouse turns the camera and its buttons press what they are bound to. Esc opens this menu and gives the pointer back.", "游戏运行时捕获鼠标：移动鼠标控制镜头，鼠标按键执行绑定的操作。按 Esc 打开菜单并释放鼠标。"},
{"Mouse", "鼠标"},
{"Degrees the camera turns for each count of mouse motion. While a bow or a bowgun aims, the mouse is slowed as Aim speed is to Camera speed.", "鼠标每移动一个单位时镜头转动的角度。弓或弩瞄准时，按瞄准速度与镜头速度的比例降低鼠标速度。"},
