{"Touch screen", "触摸屏"},
{"A pad drawn over the game once the screen is touched: a stick that appears where the left thumb lands, the face buttons on the right, L and R at the top corners. A drag on the free right half turns the camera. It hides again when a gamepad or the keyboard is used.", "触摸屏幕后显示虚拟手柄：左拇指处出现摇杆，右侧为面部按键，顶部两角为 L 和 R。在右侧空白区域拖动可转动镜头。使用手柄或键盘时自动隐藏。"},
{"On-screen controls", "屏幕虚拟按键"},
{"On-screen controls are off", "屏幕虚拟按键已关闭"},
{"A D-pad at the left edge, for the game's menus, the item box and the camera's D-pad controls. Off gives its place to the stick.", "在屏幕左侧显示方向键，用于游戏菜单、道具箱及镜头控制。关闭后将该区域让给摇杆。"},
