{"Log every call and packet", "记录所有调用与数据包"},
{"The same as MHP3RD_TRACE_ADHOC=1: every ad hoc call and packet header goes to the console and to the network log. Busy; for finding a problem.", "等同于 MHP3RD_TRACE_ADHOC=1：将每次 ad hoc 调用和包头写入控制台及联机日志。日志量较大，仅用于排查问题。"},
