{"Drop the server connection and connect again at once. The group is joined again; a quest in progress may end, as when a connection drops.", "断开服务器并立即重连，然后重新加入分组。正在进行的任务可能因断线而结束。"},
{"Disconnect", "断开连接"},
{"Leave the group as if the other players were lost. The game shows its own disconnection message.", "离开当前分组，游戏会显示自己的断线提示。"},
