{"Pause the game when the menu opens", "打开菜单时暂停游戏"},
{"On: the game stops while this menu is open. Off: it keeps running and playing sound behind the menu, which takes all input. Applies the next time the menu opens.", "开启：菜单打开时暂停游戏。关闭：游戏在菜单后继续运行和播放声音，所有输入由菜单接收。下次打开菜单时生效。"},
{"Pause during multiplayer", "联机时也暂停"},
{"In ad hoc play the game keeps running behind the menu unless this is on: a paused game stops answering the other players and can drop a quest. Applies the next time the menu opens.", "默认联机时游戏在菜单后继续运行。开启暂停会停止回应其他玩家，可能导致任务断线。下次打开菜单时生效。"},
{"Save the log…", "保存日志…"},
{"Copies Yakumo's logs (this run's, the previous run's and the logs folder) to a folder you pick, to send with a problem report.", "将本次、上次运行日志及 logs 文件夹复制到你选择的目录，以便提交问题报告。"},
