{"Choose the image next, in Android's file picker. Yakumo copies it into its own storage (an app cannot keep reading a file elsewhere), checks that it is the right release and prepares the game from it. The copy needs about 1.3 GB of free space, besides the 0.8 GB the app takes; once it is made, the original can be deleted. Nothing is downloaded.", "接下来在 Android 文件选择器中选择镜像。Yakumo 会将其复制到应用存储中，验证版本并准备游戏。除应用占用的约 0.8 GB 外，还需要约 1.3 GB 空间。复制完成后可删除原文件。此过程不会下载任何内容。"},
{"Choose the image next. Yakumo checks that it is the right release, prepares the game from it and, unless you choose otherwise, copies it into its data folder so the game keeps working if the original is moved or deleted. Nothing is downloaded.", "接下来选择镜像。Yakumo 会验证版本并准备游戏。默认将镜像复制到数据文件夹，之后移动或删除原文件也不影响游戏。此过程不会下载任何内容。"},
